<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Appendix: Supplementary Results</h2>

<section id="A1.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">A.1 </span>Pretraining Data Statistics</h3>

<div id="A1.SS1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><a href="#A1.T2" title="In A.1 Pretraining Data Statistics ‣ Appendix A Appendix: Supplementary Results ‣ LMEnt: A Suite for Analyzing Knowledge in Language Models from Pretraining Data to Representations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Tab.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a> summarize statistics over the <span id="A1.SS1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">LMEnt</span> pretraining corpus. These results support the overview provided in §<a href="#S4" title="4 The LMEnt Suite ‣ LMEnt: A Suite for Analyzing Knowledge in Language Models from Pretraining Data to Representations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
